[[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the crankcase oil sump partition (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002144.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the crankcase oil sump partition back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo and remove the engine oil level sensor.</p><p>2. Remove the connector for the condensation oil return pipe to the sump.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and remove the crankcase oil sump partition (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002145.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the crankcase oil sump partition back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Place the connector for the condensation oil return pipe to the sump back in its housing.</p><p>Place the engine oil level sensor back in its housing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000866.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the crankcase oil sump partition (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002146.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the crankcase oil sump partition and fix it tightening the bolts to torque.</p>"]]